# A server that did not list mechanisms in LS (sasl without a value) and
# rejects PLAIN with a 908 list. PLAIN is our only mechanism for SaslPlain, so
# there is nothing to retry with: CAP END follows. The retry itself, which
# needs a second mechanism, is in sasl.rs's unit tests.
= auth sasl-plain
= account-password pw
= caps multi-prefix
> CAP LS 302
> NICK textual
> USER textual 0 * Textual
< :irc.example CAP * LS :multi-prefix sasl
> CAP REQ :multi-prefix sasl
< :irc.example CAP * ACK :multi-prefix sasl
> AUTHENTICATE PLAIN
< :irc.example 908 * EXTERNAL :are available SASL mechanisms
< :irc.example 904 * :SASL authentication failed
> CAP END
? notice SASL failed: SASL authentication failed
< :irc.example 001 textual :Welcome
? registered textual
